ames>KE</given-names></name><name><surname>Wishner</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Beyond "compliance" is "adherence". Improving the prospect of diabetes care</article-title><source>Diabetes Care</source><year>1999</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>635</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10189544</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.2337/diacare.22.4.635</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B21"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>McCord</surname><given-names>EC</given-names></name><name><surname>Brandenburg</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Beliefs and attitudes of persons with diabetes</article-title><source>Fam Med</source><year>1995</year><volume>27</volume><fpage>267</fpage><lpage>71</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7797006</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B22"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mansour</surname><given-names>AA</given-names></name><name><surname>Habib</surname><given-names>OS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Metformin discontinuation rate among patients with type-2 diabetes mellitus in Basrah, Iraq</article-title><source>Saudi Med J</source><year>2007</year><volume>28</volume><fpage>1919</fpage><lpage>21</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18060234</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B23"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Polonsky</surname><given-names>WH</given-names></name><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Guzman</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Villa-Caballero</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Edelman</surname><given-names>SV</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Psychological insulin resistance in patients with type 2 diabetes: the scope of the problem</article-title><source>Diabet